{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Koe de Oshigoto","Koe de Oshigoto! is a story about Aoyagi Kanna, a 16 year-old girl who was asked to become an erotic game voice actress on her 16th birthday by her 28 year-old sister at her ero-ge company. Can she do the job properly while she's still innocent and inexperienced?"],"ja":["こえでおしごと! The ANIMATION",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-8876","ids":{"shikimori":8876,"mal":8876,"anilist":8876,"kodik":"serial-31822"},"kodikIds":["serial-7628","serial-21636","serial-31822"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-7628":"2019-11-24T09:36:02Z","serial-21636":"2020-01-22T21:11:00Z","serial-31822":"2021-01-14T23:21:06Z"},"title":"Работа для голоса!","originalTitle":"Koe de Oshigoto! The Animation","alt":"Работаю Ртом / Работа голосом Koe de Oshigoto こえでおしごと! The ANIMATION","description":"Неплохой подарочек на шестнадцатый день рождения получила Канна Аояги, когда старшая сестра попросила её стать сэйю (актриса озвучивания) для эротической игры. А учитывая скромный и застенчивый характер Канны... Но деваться некуда (ну, не откажешь же своей любимой сестре). Работа есть работа!","year":2010,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","этти","култура отаку","шоу бизнес"],"rating":6.85,"popularity":21673,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/8876/a5c844b7c0066419b8460eb7aa7e3743.jpeg","width":715,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n8876-HEQGMelJZDt1.jpg","width":1416,"height":410}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-608","dubId":"608","label":"Ancord","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-7628","translationId":"608","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/200623/708974da697d4dab91a3c84b5a2bef71/7